{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09087","headline":"途中寄杨邈裴绪示襃子 · 韦应物","name":"途中寄杨邈裴绪示襃子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上宰领淮右，下国属星驰。\n雾野腾晓骑，霜竿裂冻旗。\n萧萧陟连冈，莽莽望空陂。\n风截鴈嘹泪，云惨树参差。\n高斋明月夜，中庭松桂姿。\n当暌一酌恨，况此两旬期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09087.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09087","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}